  "comments": "<p>Legends in the 11 Official Languages of the Republic of South Africa:<br>Afrikaans: Suid-Afrika<br>English: South Africa<br>Sesotho and Sepedi: Afrika Borwa<br>Tswana: Aforika Borwa<br>Xhosa: uMzantsi Afrika<br>Zulu: iNingizimu Afrika<br>Ndebele: iSewula frika<br>Venda: Afurika Tshipembe<br>siSwati: Ningizimu Afrika<br>Tsonga: Afrika Dzonga</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Variations on the obverse exist with both smaller and larger lettering, as well as the spacing between the numbers of the date. &nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/66edf647299f2.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/66edf647299f2.jpg\"></a></p><p>LDC63</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>There is also a 90<sup>o</sup> rotation error of the reverse.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/66edf5c8bb18d.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/66edf5c8bb18d.jpg\"></a></p><p>LDC63</p>",
